          {
            "text": "渐渐 describes change unfolding by degrees over time. A single abrupt change does not fit this frame.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "天渐渐冷了。",
                "pinyin": "tiān jiànjiàn lěng le 。",
                "meaning": "It gradually became cold.",
